 me (night drop if past 6 pm).  Can pick back up that evening.  Issues: 1
 ) Low coolant + steam\, 2) Low brake fluid 3) Trim flaking off 4)  Auto 
 stop/start feature intermittent Could stop by Kia and they can add some 
 coolant in the meantime.
