 pril 30\, 2010\nFlight 3090:\n\\tDeparting Indianapolis\, IN (IND) at 7:
 22 PM\n\\tArriving Milwaukee\, WI (MKE) at 7:25 PM CT\n\n\nSunday\, May 
 02\, 2010\nFlight 3075:\n\\tDeparting Milwaukee\, WI (MKE) at 6:55 PM CT
