DESCRIPTION:Notes:\nThis holiday is designated as "Washington's Birthday"
  in section 6103(a) of title 5 of the United States Code\, which is the 
 law that specifies holidays for Federal employees. Though other institut
 ions such as state and local governments and private businesses may use 
 other names\, it is our policy to always refer to holidays by the names 
 designated in the law.\n\nOPM.gov URL: https://www.opm.gov/policy-data-o
 versight/pay-leave/federal-holidays/tabs/2028/
END:VEVENT
