DESCRIPTION:Notes:\nIf a holiday falls on a Saturday\, for most Federal e
 mployees\, the preceding Friday will be treated as a holiday for pay and
  leave purposes. (See 5 U.S.C. 6103(b).) If a holiday falls on a Sunday\
 , for most Federal employees\, the following Monday will be treated as a
  holiday for pay and leave purposes. (See Section 3(a) of Executive Orde
